  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PINGO 2007-2016</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PINGO 2007-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PINGO&apos;s Forum har beg&#xe4;rt en ett&#xe5;rig f&#xf6;rl&#xe4;ngning och ytterligare       2,000,000 kronor som till&#xe4;gg f&#xf6;r p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende avtal. Det motsvarar        ungef&#xe4;r 32% av den totala budgeten (SEK 6 258 000) f&#xf6;r                verksamhetsperioden juli 2013 till juni 2014. Resterande belopp om    4,258,000 kronor ska komma fr&#xe5;n andra samarbetsparter (Ireland Aid,   OISEA, Ford Foundation, IWGIA m.fl.).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PINGO&apos;s Forum is requesting from Swedish Embassy for a one year cost  extension with the additional sum of SEK 2 000 000 which is about 32% of the total budget (SEK 6 258 000) for July 2013-June 2014           Operational Plan and Budget. The remaining sum of SEK 4 258 000 shall come from other partners (Ireland Aid, OISEA, Ford Foundation, IWGIA  and Others)</narrative>
  </description>
